@startuml Create Competition Sequence

actor Organizer
participant "Competition Controller" as CC
participant "Competition Service" as CS
participant "Competition Repository" as CR

Organizer -> CC: POST /competitions (competition data)
CC -> CS: CreateCompetition(authInfo, competition)
CS -> CS: Validate deadline
CS -> CR: Create(competition)
CR --> CS: Created competition
CS --> CC: Success response
CC --> Organizer: 201 Created + competition data

@enduml
